        "Create a public Java class named BookScan. For a multi-line text and a target word length, count how many times words of that length appear and return which line numbers they appear on. The class must include and use the logic of the three methods above (#18 substring counting, #23 string length, #27 upper-lower case flip). Return only the complete compilable Java source code for BookScan."
